OL,3,GNEWSAThe man accused of tricking his
OL,4,Afriends out of #50,000
OL,5,
OL,6,FActor, football manager, chef and
OL,7,Fboyfriend - Matthew Carroll has had
OL,8,Fmany guises.
OL,10,FA BBC investigation has uncovered an
OL,11,Fextraordinary web of deception one man
OL,12,Fis alleged to have spun across the UK
OL,13,Fover the past five years, leaving
OL,14,Fdozens of people collectively claiming
OL,15,Fto be almost #50,000 out of pocket.
OL,17,FThose who spoke to the BBC say Matthew
OL,18,FCarroll's trail of deceit, including
OL,19,Fclaims he had landed a starring role in
OL,20,Fa Marvel film and was seriously ill,
OL,21,Fhave left them questioning who they can
OL,22,Ftrust. They now want to warn others.
